--- !u!114 &432343089
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 432343085}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1c0eb6b21a73f2041bfd66ccd0e9a152, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueLines:
  - speaker: 0
    text: Well well well, what do we have here?
  - speaker: 0
    text: It looks like lunch has arrived on time.
  - speaker: 1
    text: Eeek! Please don't eat me!
  - speaker: 0
    text: 'I can''t help it, you look so tasty and I''m salivating... '
  - speaker: 0
    text: The only thing that'll save you is if you have something for me to eat
      instead of you.
  - speaker: 1
    text: Okay okay, I was going to save this for myself but I guess you can have
      it if you spare my life.
  - speaker: 0
    text: Hmm, what is it?
  - speaker: 1
    text: 'It''s a piece of bread! '
  - speaker: 1
    text: I heard cats like bread?
  - speaker: 1
    text: I'll give it to you if you spare mercy on me...
  - speaker: 0
    text: Hmm, I do like bread.
  - speaker: 0
    text: 'Okay fine. '
  - speaker: 0
    text: Hand it over.
  - speaker: 1
    text: '*Hands over a piece of bread*'
  - speaker: 0
    text: '*Eats bread*'
  - speaker: 0
    text: '*Chewing* '
  - speaker: 0
    text: Oh wow.
  - speaker: 0
    text: It's actually pretty good.
  - speaker: 0
    text: Where did you get this?
  - speaker: 1
    text: It's a piece of bread that I carried over from Arcadia.
  - speaker: 0
    text: Arcadia?
  - speaker: 1
    text: You've never heard of Arcadia?
  - speaker: 0
    text: ...
  - speaker: 1
    text: Well it's a santuary where unlimited food is vowed to appear and safety
      is guarenteed!
  - speaker: 0
    text: ...
  - speaker: 1
    text: I'm actually from Arcadia you see.
  - speaker: 1
    text: And I accidentally stumbled into this world by accident.
  - speaker: 1
    text: But this world's pretty interesting you see.
  - speaker: 1
    text: It's exciting and exhilarating you know?
  - speaker: 1
    text: I've explored all of Arcadia so there's nothing new to see or do.
  - speaker: 1
    text: But this world's pretty neat!
  - speaker: 0
    text: ...
  - speaker: 1
    text: Oh.
  - speaker: 1
    text: I've been talking way too much haven't I...
  - speaker: 0
    text: ...
  - speaker: 0
    text: Tell me which direction Arcadia is.
  - speaker: 0
    text: I want to see this place for myself.
  - speaker: 0
    text: And perhaps I will let you live if you tell me.
  - speaker: 1
    text: What?!
  - speaker: 1
    text: You promised me that you wouldn't eat me if I gave you my bread!
  - speaker: 0
    text: That was then.
  - speaker: 0
    text: But now my appetite has grown.
  - speaker: 0
    text: If you wish to live and explore this desolated land that you love so much.
  - speaker: 0
    text: Then tell me where Arcadia is.
  - speaker: 1
    text: Okay okay.
  - speaker: 1
    text: I don't exactly know where it's located.
  - speaker: 1
    text: But I do remember that it's nearby.
  - speaker: 1
    text: This area was the first place I've seen after stepping out of Arcadia.
  - speaker: 1
    text: So it shouldn't be too far off right?
  - speaker: 0
    text: ...
  - speaker: 1
    text: ...right?
  - speaker: 0
    text: ...
  - speaker: 0
    text: I'll take a look around.
  - speaker: 1
    text: Uhh... Great! I'm pretty sure it's around here somewhere.
  - speaker: 0
    text: '*Rain animation is suppose to happen here*'
  - speaker: 0
    text: Great, now it's raining.
  - speaker: 1
    text: 'Eek! '
  - speaker: 1
    text: One thing I hate about this world-
  - speaker: 1
    text: IS THE RAIN!
  dialogueUI: {fileID: 741082908}
  dialogueText: {fileID: 1219159426}
  nameText: {fileID: 1258714718}
  portraitImage: {fileID: 252152096}
  catPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: df2987c3ff729bc479afcc5c5f174e97, type: 3}
